# 二进制文件：禁止 CRLF 转换，防止 core.autocrlf 剥离 0x0D 字节损坏资产（0.5.0 曾踩坑：全部 PNG/wasm/ttf 被剥离 CR）
*.png binary
# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF：cmd.exe 解析 LF-only 版会错乱（跳过主体、pause 不执行 → 双击闪退）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.wasm binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pfb binary
*.bcmap binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.bin binary
*.7z binary
*.jar binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
